msgid ""
"Limit which MCP resources and actions this key can access. These scopes "
"do not restrict REST API requests and never grant permissions the user "
"does not already have. Leave empty for legacy RBAC-only behavior."
msgstr ""
"Ierobežojiet, kuriem MCP resursiem un darbībām šī atslēga var piekļūt. "
"Šie tvērumi neierobežo REST API pieprasījumus un nekad nepiešķir "
