" darbību tikai ar RBAC."

msgid ""
"Limits the number of cells that get retrieved. Not applied when non-"
"additive metrics (e.g. ratios, COUNT_DISTINCT, AVG, percentiles) are "
"present, since totals and subtotals are then computed via a database "
"rollup query that must see every row to stay correct."
msgstr ""
"Ierobežo izgūstamo šūnu skaitu. Netiek piemērots, ja ir neaditīvas "
"metrikas (piem., attiecības, COUNT_DISTINCT, AVG, procentiles), jo tad "
"kopsummas un starpsummas tiek aprēķinātas ar datubāzes rollup vaicājumu, "
"kam jāredz katra rinda, lai rezultāts būtu pareizs."

msgid "Limits the number of rows that get displayed."
msgstr "Ierobežo attēlojamo rindu skaitu."

msgid ""
"Limits the number of series that get displayed. A joined subquery (or an "
"extra phase where subqueries are not supported) is applied to limit the "
"number of series that get fetched and rendered. This feature is useful "
"when grouping by high cardinality column(s) though does increase the "
"query complexity and cost."
msgstr ""
"Ierobežo attēloto sēriju skaitu. Lai ierobežotu izgūto un renderēto "
"sēriju skaitu, tiek piemērots apvienots apakšvaicājums (vai papildu fāze,"
" ja apakšvaicājumi netiek atbalstīti). Šī funkcija ir noderīga, grupējot "
"pēc kolonnām ar augstu kardinalitāti, tomēr tā palielina vaicājuma "
"sarežģītību un izmaksas."

msgid ""
"Limits the number of the rows that are computed in the query that is the "
